{"id": "JAH-SIG-ORBITALM-000001", "slug": "tool-orbital-mechanics-solver-signature", "title": "Orbital Mechanics Solver \u2014 Overview and definition", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 1, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Computes orbital states, transfers, perturbations, and related quantities. The Orbital Mechanics Solver computes the quantities mission designers need: orbital elements from state vectors, Hohmann transfer delta-v between circular orbits, orbital period from semi-major axis, and first-order perturbation estimates. All calculations use standard two-body mechanics with documented assumptions, and results carry their units and precision. Engineering analysis tool \u2014 a calculation aid, not flight software. Capability specification and design target: this database describes what the tool must do, not a claim of implementation or deployment. Defensive and engineering content only \u2014 no weapon-targeting or attack-execution content.", "capabilities": ["State vector to orbital elements conversion", "Hohmann transfer delta-v calculation", "Orbital period and velocity computation", "Perturbation magnitude estimates", "Unit-consistent, documented calculations"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Tool overview and capability inventory", "code": "J({tool:TOOL.name,capabilities:TOOL.capabilities,count:TOOL.capabilities.length});assert(TOOL.capabilities.length>=5,'caps');", "verified_output": "{\"tool\":\"Orbital Mechanics Solver\",\"capabilities\":[\"State vector to orbital elements conversion\",\"Hohmann transfer delta-v calculation\",\"Orbital period and velocity computation\",\"Perturbation magnitude estimates\",\"Unit-consistent, documented calculations\"],\"count\":5}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"